WEBVTT

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:18.670
On second thought, perhaps we should turn back to save Haku-sama?

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.460
I would if I could, y'know.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.830
But we can't, Ruru-yan.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.900
She's right.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.410
The river's flowing too fast for us 
to make it back to the capital.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.930
But...

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.240
It'll be okay, Rurutie.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.100
No matter what,

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.670
no matter the danger he's in, he'll be 
back with that relaxed expression of his.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.570
That's Haku for you.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.560
You would forsake Yamato to protect the princess?

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:34.030
Is that the path you have chosen, Oshutoru?

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:35.630
What of it?

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:39.030
The princess is the next Empress of Yamato.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.400
Is it not a given that those truly loyal to Yamato would protect her?

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:50.050
Will those minuscule shoulders carry the burden of an entire nation?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:56.060
Will those slender arms forge us a path towards our future?

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:59.050
No! I think not!

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.770
The princess is young, yes.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.060
For that we will have to support her and...

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:08.410
Manipulate her as your puppet?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:15.560
Try as you might to twist your words and hide their meaning, your intention remains thus.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.100
Vurai...

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:25.470
Without the Emperor to hold it together, 
Yamato will fall once more into civil war.

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.720
Only he who wields the absolute power

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.130
can prevent this!

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:37.910
I, Vurai, shall become the 
new Emperor of Yamato.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:43.440
That is the path <i>you</i> have chosen, then?

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:59.990
The two of us live for naught but war.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:04.730
Our fists and blades speak for us!

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:07.060
You are correct.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:10.500
Indeed, that is the kind of man you are.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.960
And I am no different.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.910
Master Haku, I leave Nekone in your care.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.260
All right.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.760
Brother...

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.590
<i>Don't lose, Oshutoru.</i>

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:49.990
Thanks, you two.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.010
Naturally.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:56.300
Protecting our master is our duty.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.990
Yeah, I can see.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.560
Those are General Vurai's own words?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.800
<i>That</i> man will become the new Emperor?

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.820
In a sense, that's just like him.

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.820
Has General Vurai gone mad?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.950
Did I not say so? Without the Emperor,

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:30.330
such a fate was the inevitable outcome for the capital.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.630
Let us go, Shichiiria.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.340
It would appear a storm is brewing.{ARRR_THERE_BE_A_SHITSTORM_ABREWING.jpg}

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.920
A storm, large enough to cover all of Yamato

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.430
and strike it into oblivion.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:54.730
Perhaps there is nothing left that can stop it.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.130
Mere child's play!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.780
Who would recognize as emperor a man

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.910
who knew naught but how to brandish his own power?

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:37.650
Ask yourself once more why you wield that power.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.100
A fool's question.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:07:01.170
My power exists to carry 
on the will of the Emperor!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.060
Brother!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.500
Don't be stupid! Stop!

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.450
Let me go!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:31.990
Calm down!

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:35.330
You'll only get in his way!

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.960
But... But...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.340
Because of me, he's going to...

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.130
It'll be fine.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.600
That guy... Oshutoru...

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.220
won't lose because of that.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.740
Haku-san...

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.230
<i>I believe in you, Oshutoru.</i>

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:07.240
To carry on the will of the Emperor?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.490
You would claim that <i>this</i> is his will?

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:21.500
If so, I shall deny you with the entirety of my body and soul!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.510
I call upon this power to protect the people, my companions,

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:31.140
and all whom I hold dear!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.520
Hey, Oshutoru!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.190
No, Brother!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:38.150
If you use the power of the 
mask when you're that hurt...

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.790
Perfect.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.530
Now <i>that</i> is the man I admire.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.150
Akuruka!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:50.170
Become the door, and open 
the path to the source!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.670
Brother!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.680
<i>Oshutoru...</i>

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:16.870
What's that light?

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:20.400
I think I saw somethin' like this in Uzuurussha.

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:24.120
Akuruturuka...

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:26.520
No...

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:32.000
Oshutoru...

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.350
Where might <i>you</i> be going, Mikazuchi?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.440
Brother!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.750
I'm going to stop them.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:04.360
A fight between two Akuruturuka must be stopped at all costs!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.360
There's no need.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:15.620
It's just two madmen fighting each other.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:20.600
We shall simply watch,
and then slay the survivor.

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:21.630
But...

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:26.130
That is the unanimous will 
of the Eight Pillar Generals.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:30.000
I would advise against taking this matter into your own hands...

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.050
Mikazuchi.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.520
<i>Oshutoru...</i>

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:03.140
This power was granted to me by the Emperor.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:06.530
As such, defeat is not an option!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:10.400
My power will <i>not</i> be tainted!

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.250
I will only cease fighting

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:19.410
when my limbs are rent from my body,

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.410
and my soul shattered!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:27.410
Vurai, your pride, your honor...

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.790
I have always respected them.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:35.460
But at this moment, I cannot yield my life!

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:52.730
Brother...

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:53.630
Nekone!

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:58.700
We need to get out of here 
and go to Ennakamui!

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.070
How can you say that?

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:04.150
My brother is fighting for his life!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.450
That's why!

00:13:05.990 --> 00:13:09.510
There's nothing we can do for him now.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.640
So we need to get out of 
here as quickly as possible,

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.970
and meet up with the others.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.580
Am I wrong?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:22.840
But... But...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.590
I can't leave him!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.350
He was barely able to stand.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:31.570
Nekone...

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:39.610
Fine.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:44.800
Honestly. Looks like blatant 
stubbornness runs in the family.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.580
Haku-san...

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.620
<i>Did you hear that, Oshutoru?</i>

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:55.920
<i>Don't make your little sister cry anymore.</i>

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.430
Oshutoru...

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.500
Brother!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.060
Is there really nothing...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.400
Is there really nothing at all I can do for him?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.070
You have one option.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:08.830
One option, should you wish to save Oshutoru-sama.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:10.210
Really!?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.210
On Ryaaku...

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.710
The sole method of sealing the masks' power.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:19.710
Such a thing exists?

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.010
"On Ryaaku"?

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:26.220
That's what the Kamunagi of Chains do?

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:32.390
As of this moment, they belong to you.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.250
Their bodies, their souls, their very existences.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.240
So it's like that, Brother?

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:44.480
Please,

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.130
lend me your power.

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.230
We humbly bow our heads

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:17.890
and offer prayer to the myriad heroic spirits who serve as foundation for our flesh.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:31.450
We beseech thee, take pity on this land of ours and grant us sanctuary!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.670
On Ryaaku!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:01.820
They did it.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.760
So this is On Ryaaku...

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.130
Oshutoru!

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:21.500
Brother!

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.570
Oshutoru!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:56.410
Not enough... Not enough... Not enough...

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.050
It is not enough!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.370
Nekone!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.710
Brother!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:47.630
Haku!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.380
Akuruka, I seek even more!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:59.350
Devour my soul and grant me the power 
that surpasses the heavens themselves!

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:02.740
Power, Akuruka! Power!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.900
Devour my soul and grant me power!

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.610
Vurai!{THIS IS LIKE THE INTERNET I SHOUT LOUDER THEREFORE I'M RIGHT FUCK YOUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU}

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.910
Oshutoru!{you know each other's names great}

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.380
Brother!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.090
Brother!{see here we have a limited-edition Vurai statue with special glowing eyes - life size, batteries not included, keep out of reach of small children}

00:21:58.830 --> 00:21:59.960
Sheesh...

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:03.340
We should be safe now.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.310
Agreed.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:08.430
Master...

00:22:09.730 --> 00:22:11.180
We also...

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:14.580
Don't worry about that. Just rest.

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:16.580
Our apologies.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:19.840
Our deepest apologies, master.

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:22.810
Man...

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:25.850
I <i>really</i> don't want to go through this again.

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:30.850
We need to get to Ennakamui
and take it easy for a while.

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:32.570
Agreed.

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:34.710
There's not much there,

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:37.450
but it's peaceful and a good place to live.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.860
I am certain it will prove to your liking.

00:22:42.580 --> 00:22:44.480
It has a hill with a great view.

00:22:44.930 --> 00:22:50.080
I took Nekone and Kiuru there to play 
all the time when they were still young.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:54.710
I can't wait.

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:57.150
I'm sure the princess will love it.

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:58.280
Indeed.

00:22:58.830 --> 00:23:00.080
Let us all go together.

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:10.280
As long as there's good food and drink there, 
I won't ask for anything more.

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:15.350
You haven't changed in the slightest.
